      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\u2022 Unity is a cross-platform game engine and platform for creating
        interactive 2D and 3D content in real time, used by both large production
        studios and independent developers. \n\u2022 Over the years, this tool has
        become one of the pillars of modern game development thanks to its accessibility,
        extensive documentation, large number of built-in features, and an active
        community that is constantly developing the engine's ecosystem."
